79
00:03:21,494 --> 00:03:22,745
I-It's Sheldon, right?

80
00:03:22,953 --> 00:03:27,333
Yes, sir. Well, Sheldon, why don't you come on up here and tell me how I'm wrong.

81
00:03:27,541 --> 00:03:28,876
-0kay.

82
