I need an rrt and a crash cart.

158
00:07:27,364 --> 00:07:28,365
Over here.

159
00:07:29,742 --> 00:07:32,620
Sir, are you having chest pains right now?

160
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:33,870
Yeah, a little bit.

161
00:07:33,996 --> 00:07:36,081
Any numbness or pain in your arms?

162
