Well, for insurance purposes, yes.

173
00:08:02,775 --> 00:08:04,234
Hey. What's goin' on?

174
00:08:04,693 --> 00:08:06,070
Dad's in the hospital.

175
00:08:06,362 --> 00:08:08,197
What? Why's dad in the hospital?

176
00:08:08,405 --> 00:08:10,085
He's gonna be fine. He had chest pains.

177
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:11,450
He's gonna be fine.

178
