Hello.

186
00:08:47,611 --> 00:08:49,113
Hi, mom. Kids okay?

187
00:08:49,321 --> 00:08:51,073
Yeah, they're fine. How's George?

188
00:08:51,448 --> 00:08:53,367
I don't know. They're running tests.

189
00:08:54,118 --> 00:08:57,538
Well, don't you worry about us.

190
00:08:57,746 --> 00:09:00,082
Everything's under control here.

191
