I'll call you when I know more.

193
00:09:04,545 --> 00:09:05,796
How you holdin' up?

194
00:09:07,006 --> 00:09:08,215
I guess I'm okay.

195
00:09:08,424 --> 00:09:10,384
Well, George is gonna pull through this, honey.

196
00:09:10,718 --> 00:09:12,594
I guarantee it.

197
