You asleep?

218
00:10:10,194 --> 00:10:11,194
No.

219
00:10:11,612 --> 00:10:12,821
Me neither.

220
00:10:13,614 --> 00:10:16,325
Every time the phone rings, I get scared.

221
00:10:18,702 --> 00:10:20,037
Me, too.

222
00:10:22,748 --> 00:10:24,708
I'm goin' to see dad. You guys want to come?

223
00:10:24,917 --> 00:10:27,628
How? Meemaw said we have to stay here.

224
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,671
You want to go or not?

225
00:10:37,846 --> 00:10:38,846
Shh.

226
00:10:40,265 --> 00:10:41,308
Shh.

227
00:10:42,726 --> 00:10:43,727
Who do I shush?

228
00:10:43,936 --> 00:10:45,020
Shh! Shh!

229
00:11:07,626 --> 00:11:08,877
What are you doing?

230
00:11:09,086 --> 00:11:10,379
I'm driving to the hospital.

231
00:11:10,587 --> 00:11:12,923
You can come with me or stay here... up to you.

232
00:11:13,173 --> 00:11:14,174
I'm comin'.

233
00:11:15,759 --> 00:11:16,759
Sheldon?

234
00:11:16,802 --> 00:11:17,427
You're 14.

235
00:11:17,636 --> 00:11:19,096
You don't know how to drive.

236
00:11:19,304 --> 00:11:20,764
I drove a tractor at 4-h camp.

237
00:11:20,973 --> 00:11:22,224
It's the same thing.

238
00:11:22,432 --> 00:11:24,601
But you sat on the farmer's lap.

239
00:11:24,810 --> 00:11:25,894
Then stay here.

240
00:11:26,103 --> 00:11:27,271
Come on, missy.

241
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:39,283
♪ Jand I whine, I'm after you

242
00:11:39,491 --> 00:11:40,492
what are you doin'?

243
00:11:40,701 --> 00:11:42,161
Travelin' music.

244
00:11:42,661 --> 00:11:43,453
Ugh.

245
00:11:43,662 --> 00:11:45,122
I'm coming with you.

246
00:11:45,330 --> 00:11:46,915
Why are you wearin' my helmet?

247
00:11:47,124 --> 00:11:49,835
I don't expect this to end well.

248
00:11:50,085 --> 00:11:51,211
And the pillows?

249
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:52,713
Same answer.

250
00:11:54,047 --> 00:11:55,507
Turn it off. I've got to concentrate.

251
00:11:55,716 --> 00:11:57,009
Aw.

252
00:11:57,384 --> 00:12:00,387
Okay, seat belts, everybody.

253
00:12:01,305 --> 00:12:02,764
Please drive slowly.

254
00:12:02,973 --> 00:12:04,850
Relax. I know what I'm doin'.

255
00:12:05,893 --> 00:12:07,060
Whoa! Whoa!

256
00:12:07,269 --> 00:12:10,981
I've often been asked why I never learned to drive a car.

257
00:12:11,190 --> 00:12:12,190
This night...

258
00:12:13,942 --> 00:12:15,277
Is your answer.

259
00:12:15,819 --> 00:12:17,154
Please slow down.

260
00:12:17,362 --> 00:12:18,562
I'm goin' eight miles an hour.

261
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,157
A cow just passed us.

262
00:12:20,365 --> 00:12:22,951
Do you know how to get to the hospital? Yeah.

263
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,120
It's right across the street from the dairy queen.

264
00:12:25,162 --> 00:12:26,580
Which dairy queen?

265
00:12:26,788 --> 00:12:27,998
What are you talkin' about?

266
00:12:28,248 --> 00:12:29,249
There's two.

267
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:30,250
Really?

268
00:12:30,459 --> 00:12:31,126
You're gonna hit it!

269
00:12:31,335 --> 00:12:32,615
Which is the one mom takes us to?

270
00:12:32,669 --> 00:12:33,669
You're gonna hit it!

271
